{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "May I Take Your Order? ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Think of a restaurant you have gone to.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe some of the food and drink on the menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph recommending the restaurant to a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say in the paragraph when you plan to go there again.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": " I talk about food and drink.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph to recommend a restaurant I have been to.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say when I am going to go there again.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the paragraph with someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Service and Help", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you offer service and help to customers, remember to be polite. The modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would </span> are used to make an offer or invite someone to do something.<br/>You can respond to requests using the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would </span>to suggest something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you respond to an offer of service or help, you should answer politely. However, this does not always happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Offer Service or Help</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Respond to Offers</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I suggest a table by the window?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That goes without saying.</span><br/>(not polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I recommend the house wine?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Definitely not.</span><br/>(not polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wouldn't recommend that, sir.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That stands to reason.</span><br/>(polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd suggest the old-fashioned way.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That stands to reason. </span><br/> (polite)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future With <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, the Present Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use three different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Deciding Now</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll bring you the menus.<br/>I'll choose something.<br/>I'll tell you the specials for tonight.<br/>However, I'll have a bottle of this Chardonnay.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Intentions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to seat you here.<br/>I'm going to propose.<br/>I'm going to put the ring in the wine.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Plans / Things On the Agenda</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">One other person is meeting me here.<br/>We're celebrating tonight.<br/>She's coming in about 10 minutes.<br/>Is your date expecting you to be seated?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "party", "type": "name"}, {"content": "group of people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How many people are in your party?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you work at a restaurant.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wine list", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wine menu in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like the wine list as well? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "house wine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "wine bought in bulk by a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could I recommend the house wine?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to propose", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask someone to be your spouse", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to propose tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "whenever", "type": "name"}, {"content": "every time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(conjunction)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Whenever the ring is in the wine, it gets swallowed!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to swallow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put down your throat when you eat or drink", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Swallow the pills with some water.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "glazed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cooked with a liquid brushed on it so it becomes shiny ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The duck is glazed with an orange sauce.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "almandine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "with almonds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're serving green beans almandine tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "trout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a fish that lives in rivers and lakes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There's also grilled rainbow trout.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "asparagus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tall spear-like green vegetable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We serve fresh asparagus with the meal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good evening. How many people are in your party? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: One other person is meeting me here. Her office closes late this week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So for two then. Do you have a reservation?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Of course. It's for Brown. Edmund Brown.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could I suggest a table by the window?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: That goes without saying.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay. I'm going to seat you here. I'll bring you the menus. Would you like the wine list as well? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span> : Certainly."}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "23500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Here you go sir. Could I recommend the house wine?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Definitely not. We're celebrating tonight. I'll choose something. I'm going to propose. I'm going to put the ring in the wine. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wouldn't recommend that sir. Whenever the ring is in the wine or inside the cake, it often gets swallowed! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: That stands to reason. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd suggest the old-fashioned way.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Hmm."}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "45500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll tell you the specials for tonight. We're serving orange glazed duck with green beans almandine. There's also grilled rainbow trout with asparagus.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Thank you. I'm not going to choose until Miranda arrives. She's coming in about 10 minutes. However, I'll have a bottle of this Chardonnay.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll bring your wine. Is your date expecting you to be seated?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Hmm ... maybe not.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll watch out for her then. I'm on the door all evening."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about food and drink at a restaurant.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can offer service and help.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you eat out at a restaurant?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How would you describe a fancy restaurant?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What type of food do you like to order?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "c